.SH "نام (NAME)"
mkarchroot \- Creates an arch chroot in a specified location with a specified set of packages
.SH "خلاصه دستور (SYNOPSIS)"
.sp
mkarchroot [options] [location] [packages]
.SH "توضیحات (DESCRIPTION)"
.sp
\fImkarchroot\fP is a script to create an Arch Linux chroot at a specified location
with specified packages. Typically used by \fImakechrootpkg\fP to create build
chroots. Apart from installing specified packages the chroot is created with an
en_US.UTF\-8 and de_DE.UTF\-8 locale and a generated machine\-id.
.SH "گزینه‌ها (OPTIONS)"
.sp
\fB\-U\fP
.RS 4
Use \fIpacman \-U\fP to install packages.
.RE
.sp
\fB\-C\fP <file>
.RS 4
Location of a pacman config file.
.RE
.sp
\fB\-M\fP <file>
.RS 4
Location of a makepkg config file.
.RE
.sp
\fB\-c\fP <dir>
.RS 4
Set pacman cache.
.RE
.sp
\fB\-f\fP <src>[:<dst>]
.RS 4
Copy file from the host to the chroot.
If \fIdst\fP is not provided, it defaults to \fIsrc\fP inside of the chroot.
.RE
.sp
\fB\-s\fP
.RS 4
Do not run setarch.
.RE
.sp
\fB\-h\fP
.RS 4
Output command line options.
.RE
.SH "همچنین ببینید (SEE ALSO)"
.sp
pacman(1)
.SH "HOMEPAGE"
.sp
\fI\c
.URL "https://gitlab.archlinux.org/archlinux/devtools" "" "\fP"
